  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1608.04 Renewal of Site Permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1608.04 Renewal of Site Permit. Any person to whom a site permit has been issued who wishes to renew the permit shall apply pursuant to Env-Wq 1603.12 to the department at least 30 days prior to expiration of the permit.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1600) #13944, eff 4-27-24",
